<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ADALUANG - Eksplorasi Peluang</title>

<style>
/* ===== VARIABEL GLOBAL (gabungan dari Kode A & B) ===== */
:root{
  --navy:#244a87;
  --blue:#3976d3;
  --light:#edf4ff;
  --purple:#8061d9;
  --green:#16865b;
  --red:#d34e5c;
  --text:#26344b;
  --muted:#68768b;
  --border:#dce5f1;
  --soft:#f7f9fc;
}

/* ===== NAVBAR LOMPAT BAGIAN (opsional, tambahan kecil) ===== */
.top-nav{
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:999;
  background:#244a87;
  padding:10px 16px;
  text-align:center;
}
.top-nav a{
  color:#fff;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin:0 12px;
  font-size:14px;
}
.top-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

/* ================================================================
   BAGIAN A — Konsep Dasar Peluang
   Semua CSS asli Kode A di-scope ke #bagianA agar tidak bentrok
   ================================================================ */
#bagianA *{box-sizing:border-box}
#bagianA{scroll-behavior:smooth}

#bagianA{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#f2f5fa;
  color:var(--text);
  line-height:1.6;
}

#bagianA header{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#244a87,#3976d3);
  color:white;
  padding:35px 20px;
  text-align:center;
}
#bagianA header h1{margin:0;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:1px}
#bagianA header p{margin:8px 0 0}

#bagianA .container{width:92%;max-width:1100px;margin:25px auto}

#bagianA .panel{
  background:white;
  padding:24px;
  border-radius:16px;
  margin-bottom:22px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(30,55,90,.07);
}
#bagianA .panel h2{color:var(--navy);margin-top:0}
#bagianA .panel h3{color:var(--blue)}

#bagianA .intro{
  background:var(--light);
  border-left:5px solid var(--blue);
  padding:15px 18px;
  border-radius:10px;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

#bagianA .visual,
#bagianA .activity{
  background:#f5f8ff;
  border:1px solid #d8e4f7;
  border-radius:13px;
  padding:20px;
  margin:18px 0;
}

#bagianA button{
  border:none;
  background:var(--blue);
  color:white;
  padding:10px 17px;
  border-radius:8px;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin:5px 3px;
}
#bagianA button:hover{filter:brightness(.92)}
#bagianA button.secondary{background:#e3eaf5;color:var(--navy)}
#bagianA button.green{background:var(--green)}
#bagianA button.purple{background:var(--purple)}
#bagianA button.red{background:var(--red)}

#bagianA input,
#bagianA select{
  padding:10px;
  border:1px solid #cbd6e5;
  border-radius:8px;
  font-size:14px;
  max-width:100%;
}
#bagianA input:focus,
#bagianA select:focus{outline:2px solid #a9c8f5}

#bagianA .result{
  background:#e8f6ef;
  border-left:5px solid var(--green);
  padding:14px 17px;
  border-radius:9px;
  margin-top:15px;
}

#bagianA .formula{
  background:#eef2ff;
  color:#344b87;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:10px;
  text-align:center;
  font-size:19px;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin:15px 0;
}

#bagianA .stats{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(130px,1fr));
  gap:12px;
  margin:15px 0;
}

#bagianA .stat-card{
  background:white;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:14px;
  text-align:center;
}
#bagianA .stat-card strong{display:block;font-size:23px;color:var(--navy)}
#bagianA .stat-card span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

#bagianA .history{
  max-height:180px;
  overflow-y:auto;
  background:white;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:9px;
  padding:12px;
  margin-top:12px;
}

#bagianA .chip{
  display:inline-block;
  background:#e5edfb;
  color:var(--navy);
  padding:5px 11px;
  border-radius:20px;
  margin:4px;
  font-size:13px;
}

#bagianA .table-wrap{width:100%;overflow-x:auto;margin:15px 0}

#bagianA table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:white}
#bagianA th,
#bagianA td{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px;text-align:center}
#bagianA th{background:#e8effa;color:var(--navy)}

#bagianA .grid-2{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:16px;
}
#bagianA .grid-3{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:12px;
}

#bagianA .info-card{
  background:white;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:11px;
  padding:15px;
}
#bagianA .info-card h4{color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 8px}

#bagianA .visual-number{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:8px;
  margin:15px 0;
}

#bagianA .number-item{
  width:43px;
  height:43px;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  background:#e3eaf5;
  border:1px solid #cbd8eb;
  border-radius:9px;
  font-weight:bold;
  color:var(--navy);
}
#bagianA .number-item.selected{
  background:#c9f0dc;
  border-color:var(--green);
  color:#126443;
}

#bagianA .slider-area{margin:15px 0}
#bagianA .slider-area input{width:100%}

#bagianA .explanation{
  background:#fff8e8;
  border-left:5px solid #e7ad35;
  border-radius:9px;
  padding:14px 17px;
  margin:15px 0;
}

/* TAMPILAN KOIN (Kode A) */
#bagianA .coin-stage{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  min-height:125px;
  margin:10px auto 18px;
}
#bagianA .coin-face{
  width:100px;
  height:100px;
  border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,#fff2b0 0%,#f6d66f 38%,#d99b24 75%,#b77b16 100%);
  border:7px solid #b77b16;
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 0 0 3px #ffe9a0,
    inset 0 0 0 6px #d49a28,
    0 5px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
  color:#704400;
  font-size:34px;
  font-weight:bold;
  text-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.5);
  transition:transform .25s ease;
}
#bagianA .coin-face.flipping{animation:coinFlipA .55s ease}
@keyframes coinFlipA{
  0%{transform:rotateY(0deg) scale(1)}
  50%{transform:rotateY(900deg) scale(.75)}
  100%{transform:rotateY(1800deg) scale(1)}
}
#bagianA .coin-caption{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:5px}

#bagianA footer{
  background:var(--navy);
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  padding:20px;
  margin-top:35px;
  font-size:14px;
}

@media(max-width:700px){
  #bagianA header h1{font-size:27px}
  #bagianA .container{width:95%}
  #bagianA .panel{padding:17px}
  #bagianA .grid-2,
  #bagianA .grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}

/* ================================================================
   BAGIAN B — Kejadian Majemuk
   Semua CSS asli Kode B di-scope ke #bagianB agar tidak bentrok
   ================================================================ */
#bagianB *{box-sizing:border-box}

#bagianB{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  color:var(--text);
  background:#f3f6fc;
  line-height:1.6;
}

#bagianB header{
  padding:30px 18px;
  text-align:center;
  color:white;
  background:linear-gradient(125deg,#244a87,#477dd0);
}
#bagianB header h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(23px,4vw,34px)}
#bagianB header p{margin:0}

#bagianB main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:20px}

#bagianB .panel{
  background:white;
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:22px;
  margin-bottom:18px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 18px #213c6310;
}

#bagianB h2,
#bagianB h3{color:var(--navy);margin-top:0}
#bagianB h2{font-size:22px}
#bagianB h3{font-size:17px}
#bagianB p{margin:9px 0}

#bagianB .note,
#bagianB .small{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

#bagianB .tabs{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  gap:9px;
}

#bagianB .tab{
  padding:12px 8px;
  background:white;
  color:var(--navy);
  border:2px solid #d9e4f5;
  border-radius:10px;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-weight:bold;
}
#bagianB .tab.active{
  background:var(--navy);
  color:white;
  border-color:var(--navy);
}

#bagianB .topic{display:none}
#bagianB .topic.active{display:block;animation:appearB .35s ease}
@keyframes appearB{
  from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}
  to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
}

#bagianB button,
#bagianB input{font:inherit}

#bagianB button{
  border:0;
  border-radius:9px;
  padding:10px 15px;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-weight:bold;
  transition:transform .15s,filter .15s;
}
#bagianB button:hover:not(:disabled){
  filter:brightness(.96);
  transform:translateY(-1px);
}
#bagianB button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}

#bagianB .primary{background:var(--blue);color:white}
#bagianB .secondary{background:#e8effb;color:var(--navy)}
#bagianB .green{background:var(--green);color:white}

#bagianB button:focus-visible,
#bagianB input:focus-visible{
  outline:3px solid #f5c451;
  outline-offset:2px;
}

#bagianB label{display:block;margin:10px 0 5px;font-weight:bold}

#bagianB input{
  width:100%;
  min-width:0;
  padding:10px 12px;
  border:1px solid #c8d4e5;
  border-radius:8px;
  background:white;
  color:var(--text);
}

#bagianB .input-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:12px;
}
#bagianB .input-grid.three{
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:12px;
}

#bagianB .visual{
  background:#f7faff;
  border:1px solid #e1eafa;
  border-radius:14px;
  padding:15px;
  margin:16px 0;
}

#bagianB .button-row{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:9px;
  margin:12px 0;
}

#bagianB .result{
  display:none;
  background:#eef8f2;
  border-left:4px solid var(--green);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:14px;
  margin-top:15px;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}
#bagianB .result.show{display:block;animation:appearB .25s ease}
#bagianB .result p{margin:7px 0}

#bagianB .math{
  background:#edf3ff;
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:10px 12px;
  margin:9px 0;
  font-size:17px;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}

#bagianB .badge{
  display:inline-block;
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:4px 10px;
  background:#e6eefc;
  color:var(--navy);
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

#bagianB .venn-svg{width:100%;max-width:570px;display:block;margin:auto}
#bagianB .venn-circle{
  transition:
    cx .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1),
    fill .4s,
    opacity .4s,
    r .4s;
}

#bagianB .venn-step{
  min-height:45px;
  background:#f7faff;
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:12px;
  margin-top:10px;
  border-left:4px solid var(--blue);
}

#bagianB .gift-scene{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  gap:28px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  padding:15px;
}
#bagianB .gift{width:112px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold}
#bagianB .gift-icon{font-size:52px;display:block;line-height:1.3}

/* KOIN 3D (Kode B) */
#bagianB .coin-stage{
  height:160px;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  perspective:700px;
}
#bagianB .coin-3d{
  width:110px;
  height:110px;
  position:relative;
  transform-style:preserve-3d;
  transition:transform .7s;
}
#bagianB .coin-face{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  border-radius:50%;
  border:7px double #d4a32b;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%,#fff6b9,#f5c644 60%,#b87b14);
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  flex-direction:column;
  color:#70440b;
  font-weight:bold;
  backface-visibility:hidden;
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px #ffe99b;
}
#bagianB .coin-face span{font-size:35px}
#bagianB .coin-face small{font-size:13px}
#bagianB .coin-back{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
#bagianB .coin-3d.flipping{animation:coinflip3dB .8s ease-in-out}
@keyframes coinflip3dB{
  0%{transform:rotateY(0)}
  50%{transform:rotateY(900deg) translateY(-25px)}
  100%{transform:rotateY(1800deg)}
}

/* DADU 3D */
#bagianB .dice-row{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  min-height:125px;
}
#bagianB .die-stage{
  width:110px;
  height:110px;
  position:relative;
  perspective:600px;
}
#bagianB .die-cube{
  position:absolute;
  width:100px;
  height:100px;
  left:5px;
  top:5px;
  transform-style:preserve-3d;
  transform:scale(.76);
}
#bagianB .face{
  position:absolute;
  width:100px;
  height:100px;
  border:3px solid #d5deeb;
  border-radius:13px;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#edf2fa);
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  grid-template-rows:repeat(3,1fr);
  padding:12px;
  backface-visibility:hidden;
}
#bagianB .face.front{transform:rotateY(0deg) translateZ(50px)}
#bagianB .face.back{transform:rotateY(180deg) translateZ(50px)}
#bagianB .face.right{transform:rotateY(90deg) translateZ(50px)}
#bagianB .face.left{transform:rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(50px)}
#bagianB .face.top{transform:rotateX(90deg) translateZ(50px)}
#bagianB .face.bottom{transform:rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(50px)}

#bagianB .pip{
  width:15px;
  height:15px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:#244a87;
  align-self:center;
  justify-self:center;
}
#bagianB .face[data-n="1"] .pip:nth-child(1){grid-area:2/2}
#bagianB .face[data-n="2"] .pip:nth-child(1){grid-area:1/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="2"] .pip:nth-child(2){grid-area:3/3}
#bagianB .face[data-n="3"] .pip:nth-child(1){grid-area:1/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="3"] .pip:nth-child(2){grid-area:2/2}
#bagianB .face[data-n="3"] .pip:nth-child(3){grid-area:3/3}
#bagianB .face[data-n="4"] .pip:nth-child(1){grid-area:1/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="4"] .pip:nth-child(2){grid-area:1/3}
#bagianB .face[data-n="4"] .pip:nth-child(3){grid-area:3/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="4"] .pip:nth-child(4){grid-area:3/3}
#bagianB .face[data-n="5"] .pip:nth-child(1){grid-area:1/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="5"] .pip:nth-child(2){grid-area:1/3}
#bagianB .face[data-n="5"] .pip:nth-child(3){grid-area:2/2}
#bagianB .face[data-n="5"] .pip:nth-child(4){grid-area:3/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="5"] .pip:nth-child(5){grid-area:3/3}
#bagianB .face[data-n="6"] .pip:nth-child(1){grid-area:1/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="6"] .pip:nth-child(2){grid-area:2/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="6"] .pip:nth-child(3){grid-area:3/1}
#bagianB .face[data-n="6"] .pip:nth-child(4){grid-area:1/3}
#bagianB .face[data-n="6"] .pip:nth-child(5){grid-area:2/3}
#bagianB .face[data-n="6"] .pip:nth-child(6){grid-area:3/3}

@keyframes rollB{
  0%{transform:scale(.76) rotateX(0) rotateY(0)}
  50%{transform:scale(.85) rotateX(900deg) rotateY(1080deg) translateY(-20px)}
  100%{transform:scale(.76) rotateX(var(--end-x)) rotateY(var(--end-y))}
}
#bagianB .die-cube.rolling{animation:rollB .8s ease-in-out}

#bagianB .independent-stats{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
  margin-top:15px;
}
#bagianB .independent-stat{
  flex:1;
  min-width:120px;
  background:#edf3fc;
  padding:12px;
  border-radius:9px;
  text-align:center;
}
#bagianB .independent-stat strong{
  display:block;
  font-size:25px;
  color:#244a87;
}
#bagianB .independent-history{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:6px;
  margin-top:10px;
}
#bagianB .independent-chip{
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:6px 10px;
  background:#edf3fc;
  font-size:13px;
}
#bagianB .independent-chip.both{
  background:#e7f8ee;
  color:#16865b;
  font-weight:bold;
}

#bagianB hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #e2e9f4;margin:18px 0}

#bagianB table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center}
#bagianB th,
#bagianB td{padding:12px;border:1px solid #d9e5f5}
#bagianB th{background:#edf4ff}

#bagianB footer{
  text-align:center;
  padding:20px;
  background:var(--navy);
  color:white;
  margin-top:35px;
}

/* KESIMPULAN AKHIR */
#bagianB #finalConclusion[hidden]{display:none !important}
#bagianB #finalConclusion{
  animation:appearB .5s ease;
  border:2px solid #b8d1f5;
}

@media(max-width:650px){
  #bagianB main{padding:12px}
  #bagianB .panel{padding:16px}
  #bagianB .tabs{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  #bagianB .input-grid.three{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
}
@media(max-width:400px){
  #bagianB .input-grid,
  #bagianB .input-grid.three{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- NAVBAR LOMPAT BAGIAN -->
<nav class="top-nav">
  <a href="#bagianA">📘 Konsep Dasar Peluang</a>
  <a href="#bagianB">📗 Kejadian Majemuk</a>
</nav>

<!-- ============================================================
     BAGIAN A — Konsep Dasar Peluang (Kode A)
     ============================================================ -->
<div id="bagianA">

<header>
  <h1>ADALUANG</h1>
  <p>Eksplorasi Konsep Dasar Peluang</p>
  <p>Belajar peluang melalui visualisasi dan simulasi interaktif</p>
</header>

<main class="container">

<div class="panel">
  <h2>Selamat Datang di ADALUANG!</h2>

  <div class="intro">
    ADALUANG merupakan media pembelajaran interaktif yang membantu
    murid mempelajari konsep peluang melalui eksplorasi, visualisasi,
    dan simulasi sederhana.
  </div>

  <h3>Petunjuk Penggunaan</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Amati penjelasan materi.</li>
    <li>Gunakan tombol atau penggeser untuk mengeksplorasi materi.</li>
    <li>Amati perubahan hasil dan penjelasan yang ditampilkan.</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<!-- RUANG SAMPEL -->
<div class="panel">
  <h2>1. Ruang Sampel</h2>

  <p>
    Ruang sampel adalah himpunan semua hasil yang mungkin muncul
    dari suatu percobaan.
  </p>

  <div class="activity">
    <h3>Eksplorasi Ruang Sampel Dua Dadu</h3>

    <p>
      Dua buah dadu dilempar bersama-sama satu kali.
      Setiap dadu memiliki enam kemungkinan hasil.
      Amati seluruh pasangan hasil yang mungkin muncul.
    </p>

    <div class="formula">n(S) = 6 × 6 = 36</div>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Dadu 1 \ Dadu 2</th>
            <th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th>
            <th>4</th><th>5</th><th>6</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="sampleTableBody"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="result">
      Banyak anggota ruang sampel dari pelemparan dua dadu
      adalah <strong>36 kemungkinan hasil</strong>.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="activity">
    <h3>Eksplorasi Diagram Pohon</h3>

    <p>
      Pilih hasil dadu pertama untuk melihat enam kemungkinan
      hasil pada dadu kedua.
    </p>

    <label for="treeFirst"><strong>Hasil Dadu Pertama:</strong></label>

